---
import BaseLayout from "../layouts/BaseLayout.astro";
---
<BaseLayout title="About FleetClaim AI" description="FleetClaim AI helps fleet operators, repair shops, and insurers manage vehicle claims with AI damage analysis and faster repair estimates.">
  <section class="section bg-gradient-to-br from-electric-50 via-white to-navy-50/70 dark:from-navy-950 dark:via-navy-950 dark:to-electric-950/30">
    <div class="section-inner grid gap-12 lg:grid-cols-[1.15fr_.85fr] lg:items-center">
      <div><span class="badge mb-6">About FleetClaim AI</span><h1 class="heading-1 mb-6">Claims intelligence built for the people keeping fleets moving.</h1><p class="body-large max-w-2xl">Our mission is simple: make every vehicle claim faster, clearer, and more accurate. FleetClaim AI turns damage photos and scattered paperwork into confident decisions, so teams can focus on keeping vehicles—and businesses—moving.</p><a href="/contact" class="btn-primary mt-8 px-7 py-4">See FleetClaim AI in action →</a></div>
      <div class="card p-8 sm:p-10"><div class="mb-5 flex h-12 w-12 items-center justify-center rounded-xl bg-electric-100 text-2xl dark:bg-electric-900/50">✦</div><h2 class="heading-3 mb-3">Built for every side of the claim</h2><p class="body-base">Built for fleet operators, repair shops, and insurance carriers—one shared source of truth for inspections, repair estimates, approvals, and settlements.</p></div>
    </div>
  </section>
  <section class="section"><div class="section-inner grid gap-8 md:grid-cols-2"><div class="card p-8"><span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-electric-500">Our team</span><h2 class="heading-2 mt-4 mb-4">Founded by industry veterans</h2><p class="body-base">We bring together experience in fleet operations, automotive repair, insurance, and applied AI to solve the operational bottlenecks teams face every day.</p></div><div class="rounded-2xl bg-navy-950 p-8 text-white dark:bg-navy-900"><span class="text-sm font-bold uppercase tracking-widest text-electric-300">The future of claims</span><h2 class="mt-4 mb-4 text-3xl font-bold">Less paperwork. More progress.</h2><p class="leading-relaxed text-navy-300">We believe modern claims should be as fast and transparent as the teams they serve.</p></div></div></section>
</BaseLayout>
